# Clasptek Prep Portal V2
# Enterprise Platform Baseline v1.0
## Enterprise Architecture & Engineering Baseline

**Document ID:** EPB-001

**Version:** 1.0

**Status:** BASELINE FROZEN

**Classification:** Enterprise Architecture Baseline

**Architecture Owner:** Enterprise Architecture Board

**Product:** Clasptek Prep Portal V2

**Baseline Date:** Sprint 2.5 Completion

---

# Executive Summary

## Purpose

This document establishes the **first Enterprise Platform Baseline** for Clasptek Prep Portal V2.

It records the complete architectural state of the platform after the completion of:

- Phase 1
- Sprint 2.1A
- Sprint 2.2
- Sprint 2.3
- Sprint 2.4
- Sprint 2.5

From this point forward, all future implementation sprints (2.6 onwards) will be measured against this baseline.

This document serves as the canonical enterprise reference for:

- Architecture
- Engineering
- Governance
- APIs
- Repository Contracts
- Domain Boundaries
- Performance Expectations
- Technical Debt

