# Enterprise Baseline Declaration

This document establishes the **Enterprise Platform Baseline v1.0** for Clasptek Prep Portal V2.

All bounded contexts, repository contracts, architecture decisions, governance artefacts, and integration boundaries described herein are **frozen** as of the completion of Sprint 2.5.

Any future architectural change that alters these frozen contracts, dependencies, or domain boundaries **must** be introduced through a new Architecture Decision Record (ADR), accompanied by updated governance documentation and explicit versioning.

This baseline serves as the official architectural reference for all implementation work from **Sprint 2.6 (Adaptive Practice Domain)** onward.

